[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4148.87, "timestamp": "01:09:08", "text": "ああ、気にしないで。私のじゃない。わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4153.392, "timestamp": "01:09:13", "text": "別のドア。わかった。えっと、私はタバコを吸わない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4155.269, "timestamp": "01:09:15", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4158.789, "timestamp": "01:09:18", "text": "そういうのは吸わない。どうして私のPCは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4163.51, "timestamp": "01:09:23", "text": "ラグがひどいんだ？どうして？こんなにひどいの？なんてこった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4174.07, "timestamp": "01:09:34", "text": "これを閉じます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4181.43, "timestamp": "01:09:41", "text": "。[咳払い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4185.349, "timestamp": "01:09:45", "text": "こんにちは。えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4188.39, "timestamp": "01:09:48", "text": "これでやってみよう。"}]